\newlabel{fig:npvcost}{{3}{3}{Top: present-value system cost to 2040, labelled with the flat \$/MWh rate on all server load that recovers the cost above the no-servers case. Bottom: 2040 national CO$_2$ relative to no servers; the gas CT and CC points serve 100\% of server load with new gas plants (no geothermal)}{figure.3}{}}
