\newlabel{fig:avgcostsummary}{{4}{4}{Public-side and server-side present-value average cost (2027--2040, \$/MWh), with the server fleet fixed and the converter on. Server cost is blended (covered MWh at the carve-out cost plus uncovered MWh at that run's public rate); gas CC and CT are separate runs that serve 100\% of server load with new gas, with server fuel charged to the servers}{figure.4}{}}
